:: Mara
<<if not $met_mara>><<set $met_mara to true>><</if>>

# Elder Mara

Mara is an old woman with sharp eyes that miss nothing. She sits on her porch, wrapped in a wool shawl despite the mild evening.

<<if $mara_trust < 1>>
"So. You're the one who answered my call." She studies you. "I sent word to three guilds. Only you came."

She gestures for you to sit. "Things have gone from bad to worse. The wolves in the forest -- they're not natural. Too big, too cunning. They've taken six sheep this month. And then there are the lights. Green lights, deep in the forest, where no one goes anymore."

She leans closer. "I need you to deal with the wolves. Kill five of them and I'll know you're serious. Then we can talk about the bigger problems."

<<set $quest_wolf_problem to "active">>
<<set $mara_trust to 1>>

''Quest Started: The Wolf Problem''
Kill 5 wolves in the Thornwood Forest. Return to Mara when done.

[[I'll handle the wolves|Town Square]]
[[Tell me more about the lights|Maras Secret]]
[[Return to the square|Town Square]]
<<else>>
<<if $quest_wolf_problem == "active" and $quest_wolf_kills >= 5>>
"You've done it! The wolves won't trouble us anymore." Mara's face softens with relief. "Here -- 50 gold for your trouble. And take this." She hands you a ''lantern''. "You'll need it for the forest at night."

<<set $quest_wolf_problem to "completed">>
<<set $gold += 50>>
<<set $xp += 100>>
<<set $has_lantern to true>>
<<set $mara_trust to 3>>
<<set $inventory.push("Lantern")>>

''Quest Completed: The Wolf Problem''
Rewards: 50 Gold, 100 XP, Lantern

"Now, about those lights in the forest... There's a clearing deep in the woods. An old shrine. I think the source of the trouble is there. And there's a traveler -- went missing three days ago. Name's Tomas. If you find him..."

<<set $quest_artifact to "active">>

''Quest Started: The Ancient Amulet''
Explore the old shrine in the forest clearing. Recover the amulet of Thornwood.

''New Lead: Elara in the tavern''
Garrett mentioned Elara is looking for her brother Tomas. Talk to her in the tavern.

[[I'll find Tomas and the shrine|Town Square]]
[[Return to the square|Town Square]]
<<elseif $quest_wolf_problem == "completed">>
<<if $amulet_recovered>>
<<if not $maras_secret_known>>
"You found the amulet. I... I need to tell you something." Mara looks away. "Fifty years ago, I was a young woman. I was there when the Keep fell. The amulet was mine -- I used it to seal the catastrophe, but I lost it in the chaos. I thought it was gone forever."

<<set $maras_secret_known to true>>
<<set $mara_trust to 5>>

"If Garrett tells you I'm hiding something... he's right. But I was trying to protect everyone. The amulet is the key to ending this. And now you have it."
<<else>>
"The amulet is safe with you. When you're ready, head to the old Keep. The source of the curse lies there."
<</if>>
<<else>>
"Have you dealt with the wolves yet? I need proof I can trust you before I share more."
<</if>>

[[Return to Mara|Mara]]
[[Return to the square|Town Square]]
<<else>>
<<if $quest_wolf_problem == "active">>
"You're back. Have you dealt with the wolves? I need 5 killed before I can trust you with the bigger tasks."
<<if $quest_wolf_kills > 0>>
"Progress: $quest_wolf_kills of 5 wolves killed."
<<else>>
"No progress yet. The forest is south of the square."
<</if>>
[[Return to the square|Town Square]]
<<else>>
"Welcome back. How can I help?"
[[Return to the square|Town Square]]
<</if>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
